    "created_at": "2016-04-13T14:15:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-13T14:15:09Z",
    "body": "What are the correct words from checking if a URL corresponds to an object and for getting that object? In Blink's implementation it doesn't have anything to do with fetching, and it's a synchronous operation. I guess https://w3c.github.io/FileAPI/#requestResponseModel should cover this, but if one expresses it in terms of an async fetch then the structure will be very different.\n\nhttps://w3c.github.io/FileAPI/#BlobURLStore is a primitive which does support synchronous operations, but there's no synchronous \"get an entry from the Blob URL Store\".\n\nThoughts?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
