    "created_at": "2016-04-21T19:13:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-21T19:14:01Z",
    "body": "Regarding https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1037#issuecomment-209926419, I'm not clear on whether or not MSE or other blob/object URLs would best be handled in the whatwg html5 spec as \"remote\" or \"local\" mode, but at least MSE and MediaStream blob/object URLs need to skip the \"remote\" mode \"optional preload none\" steps.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
