    "created_at": "2016-04-30T15:16:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-30T15:16:15Z",
    "body": "I think the thing that is missing is that later on you don't actually use the object given by the URL. Fetch has a way of turning that into a response, but it seems that for the local mode you don't invoke fetch.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
