    "created_at": "2016-06-08T12:30:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-08T12:30:30Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I didn't know it had spread beyond `Blob` objects, but I guess it has. I was hoping any new kind of resource we'd just support direct object assignment. File an issue?\n\nYou need to read the object somehow. Maybe the implicitness is okay for now though.\n",
